WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:00.975
Gall

00:00:01.175 --> 00:00:02.401
a from-scratch Metal

00:00:02.213 --> 00:00:03.616
engine runs Inkling

00:00:03.428 --> 00:00:04.170
2 Mini

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:05.452
Gall is a

00:00:05.264 --> 00:00:06.478
menu-bar app with

00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:07.292
a Rust host

00:00:07.175 --> 00:00:08.235
and custom Metal

00:00:08.047 --> 00:00:09.143
kernels that serves

00:00:08.955 --> 00:00:09.875
Thinking Machines'

00:00:09.686 --> 00:00:10.948
Inkling 2 Mini

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:11.608
as a local

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:13.236
OpenAI-compatible API

00:00:13.366 --> 00:00:14.261
and unloads it

00:00:14.073 --> 00:00:15.099
from RAM between

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:15.724
messages

00:00:16.246 --> 00:00:17.448
Inkling 2 Mini

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:19.524
is a 26B-parameter

00:00:19.336 --> 00:00:20.408
mixture-of-experts

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:21.411
model with 3

00:00:21.222 --> 00:00:21.705
.

00:00:21.517 --> 00:00:23.085
4B parameters active

00:00:22.897 --> 00:00:23.687
per token

00:00:24.206 --> 00:00:25.703
Gall reads Unsloth's

00:00:25.515 --> 00:00:28.227
UD-IQ3XXS GGUF in

00:00:28.039 --> 00:00:29.830
place without ggml

00:00:29.784 --> 00:00:30.762
or MLX

00:00:30.881 --> 00:00:31.882
supports text

00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:32.625
images

00:00:32.708 --> 00:00:33.734
tool calls and

00:00:33.546 --> 00:00:35.231
structured JSON and

00:00:35.055 --> 00:00:36.352
generates about 20

00:00:36.164 --> 00:00:37.460
tokens per second

00:00:37.272 --> 00:00:38.356
on an M2

00:00:38.168 --> 00:00:39.111
MacBook Air

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:40.644
Full story on

00:00:40.455 --> 00:00:41.351
the dashboard
